<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA ENDS PHARE PROGRAMME.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA ENDS PHARE PROGRAMME.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unibanka said on Tuesday that it completed in April a two-year EU PHARE training programme.</p>
<p>The consultancy programme, run by Britain's Barclays Bank helped Unibanka to improve existing services and offer new ones, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Apart from resource management and marketing development an internal audit system was created, the bank said.</p>
<p>The programme also meant that Unibanka could start activities in spheres new for Latvia's banking sector such as a GDR programme and a private placement of shares.</p>
<p>&quot;The programme was a success, which can also be seen from Unibanka's results,&quot; Unibanka president Andris Berzinsh said.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
